=== Q2-B: starvation and ageing ===
One 60 s job at priority 5 competes with a stream of one-second jobs
at priority 1 arriving at every t = 1,2,3,... (endless supply).

strict priority      film NEVER completes within 2000 units (starved); thumbnails served=1999
priority + ageing    film completes at t=309   thumbnails served=249 avg thumb wait=0.0

Interpretation: without ageing the long job is pushed back by every
new short job; ageing raises its effective priority while it waits,
so its completion time becomes bounded.
